For those of you without coords...

You can find some thieves and bandits at noonshade ruins directly east of Gadgetztan as some people said already.&nbsp; 

But you can also find more further east and slightly south of noonshade right before you get to steamwheel port.&nbsp; There are also more south of those mobs.&nbsp; Just look for the tents and check around the tents.&nbsp; I think the area is called Waterspring something.&nbsp; Good luck.&nbsp;
